        <fields>
            <name>Display</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;Before submitting an escalation attempt, please make sure you have followed the Support Rules of Engagement process &lt;a href=&quot;https://wiki.ringcentral.com/x/l3UVIQ&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;https://wiki.ringcentral.com/x/l3UVIQ&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wiki.ringcentral.com/x/l3UVIQ&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&amp;amp; have contacted the case owner and/or their supervisor to prioritize first.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Understand the urgency and impact for the customer/business, not just customer perception:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Priority 1 (Critical) – Needs attention immediately. Customer is hard down or business is severely impacted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Priority 2 (Urgent) – Customer is frustrated; issue is causing business impact. Speedy support engagement is required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Priority 3 (High) – Customer is frustrated, but not impacting core services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Priority 4 (Medium) - Most cases.&amp;nbsp;Inconvenient issues like usage or cosmetic/UI problems, but not impacting core services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Please note that after you click Submit, this case’s ‘Escalate To’ field will be updated to Support Escalations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Please fill out the below case comment with a business justification for the escalation request, include as much detail as possible so the appropriate resources can be engaged to resolve the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
